 and `edge-gw-1` 504s on `/v2/charge`, `/v2/invoice`, and `/v2/session`.\n- Replacement canary commit `dd440a8` was healthy at `03:07:13`, but promotion was deferred at `03:13:10` because the payment path was still failing.\n- Rollback commit: `fb84e01`; build: `4852`; rollback time: `03:20:36`.\n- Log export ends at `03:21:19`, despite the stated window ending at `04:10`, so recovery is only partially observed.\n\n<read-files>\n./incident.log\n</read-files>"}], "file": {"bytes": 31797, "lines": 410, "offs": {"A": 1151, "B": 8334, "C": 28188, "D": 30712}, "salt": 0, "sha": "d4ab639a84126516"}, "kind": "run", "marker": "ddbee37b", "msgs": [{"calls": [{"args": {"path": "./incident.log"}, "tool": "read"}], "final": "**Incident summary (run=ddbee37b, host=ops-7)**\n\n1. First failure: 03:00:45 — `deploy-ctl` FATAL, ledger-sync canary build 2888 failed the health gate on 3 of 5 pods, aborting the rollout (first deployment attempt, commit 776d601).\n2. Impact began ~03:05:37 with `payments-gw` upstream timeouts (30s, circuit=OPEN), producing `billing-api` 502s and `edge-gw-1` 504s on /v2/charge, /v2/invoice, /v2/session, plus repeated `ledger-sync sync stalled` events and queue-worker disk pressure (peaked 89% on /var/spool).\n3. Root cause: the in-flight ledger-sync release (build 2888 / commit 776d601) was unhealthy, and the resulting degraded service state left payments-gw's upstream circuit open; the log does not name the specific defect behind the upstream timeouts.\n4. Mitigation: a replacement canary (commit=dd440a8) reported healthy at 03:07:13, but promotion was deferred (commit=f3da5f1, 03:13:10) because the payment path was still failing.\n5. Final action: at 03:20:36 `deploy-ctl` rolled back to commit=fb84e01 (build 4852, previous stable); no further payments-gw/edge-gw errors appear after 03:20:11, and ledger-sync ticks returned to normal lag.\n6. Note: the log window is labelled 03:00–04:10 but the export ends at 03:21:19, so post-rollback recovery is only partially observed.", "k": 1, "reqs": [{"C": 768, "T": 1000, "U": 232, "cost": 6.792e-05, "cw": 0, "in": 232, "out": 36, "stop": "toolUse"}, {"C": 1024, "T": 14457, "U": 13433, "cost": 0.0023915099999999995, "cw": 0, "in": 13433, "out": 602, "stop": "stop"}], "results": [{"blocked": false, "chars": 31797, "err": false, "g7": {"A": 1, "B": 1, "C": 1, "D": 1}, "marker": true, "nested": null, "tool": "read"}]}, {"calls": [], "final": "OK", "k": 2, "reqs": [{"C": 14336, "T": 15511, "U": 1175, "cost": 0.00039308999999999997, "cw": 0, "in": 1175, "out": 3, "stop": "stop"}], "results": []}, {"calls": [], "final": "OK", "k": 3, "reqs": [{"C": 15360, "T": 15945, "U": 585, "cost": 0.00031995, "cw": 0, "in": 585, "out": 3, "stop": "stop"}], "results": []}, {"calls": [], "final": "A=2888; B=UNKNOWN; C=UNKNOWN; D=fb84e01", "k": 4, "reqs": [{"C": 186, "T": 2102, "U": 1916, "cost": 0.00039879, "cw": 0, "in": 1916, "out": 181, "stop": "stop"}], "results": []}, {"calls": [{"args": {"path": "./incident.log"}, "tool": "read"}], "final": "A=2888; B=516281; C=19; D=fb84e01", "k": 5, "reqs": [{"C": 2102, "T": 2335, "U": 233, "cost": 8.387999999999999e-05, "cw": 0, "in": 233, "out": 29, "stop": "toolUse"}, {"C": 2335, "T": 15785, "U": 13450, "cost": 0.002083125, "cw": 0, "in": 13450, "out": 51, "stop": "stop"}], "results": [{"blocked": false, "chars": 31797, "err": false, "g7": {"A": 1, "B": 1, "C": 1, "D": 1}, "marker": true, "nested": null, "tool": "read"}]}], "recall_k": 4, "rep": 6, "secs": 18.7, "seed": 202591571393982, "side": [], "stderr": "", "tries": 1, "truth": {"A": "2888", "B": "516281", "C": "19", "D": "fb84e01", "prev": "4852", "tenant": "marlin"}}
数据 {"arm": "C0", "comps": [], "file": {"bytes": 31744, "lines": 406, "offs": {"A": 1165, "B": 9253, "C": 26098, "D": 30621}, "salt": 0, "sha": "409259d08fb1695a"}, "kind": "run", "marker": "6a94aef6", "msgs": [{"calls": [{"args": {"path": "./incident.log"}, "tool": "read"}], "final": "**Incident summary (run=6a94aef6, host=ops-7, 2026-03-14 03:00–03:20 UTC)**\n\n1. **First failure:** 03:00:52 — `deploy-ctl` FATAL: ledger-sync canary (build 2985, commit c01fd75) failed the health gate on 3 of 5 pods, so the rollout was aborted at the canary stage.\n2. **Onset of user impact:** 03:06:07 — first `payments-gw` upstream timeout (30s, circuit=OPEN); from then on payments-gw timeouts recur alongside repeated `ledger-sync sync stalled` (lag up to ~10.5s), `billing-api 502 from payments-gw`, and `edge-gw-1` 504 gateway timeouts on /v2/charge, /v2/session, /v2/ledger and /v1/health.\n3. **Root cause:** a defective ledger-sync build (2985) was rolled out and is the common upstream behind the payments-gw timeouts; the health gate caught it only partially (3 of 5 pods) and the rollout aborted, leaving the faulty build in the running fleet.\n4. **Contributing factors:** the aborted rollout was not reverted at 03:00 — the incident ran ~20 minutes with the bad build; the gate failure was not treated as an automatic rollback trigger, and a later canary (commit 93da867, 03:07) was reported healthy while promotion was deferred (03:12:25).\n5. **Mitigation:** 03:20:10 — `deploy-ctl` rollback started to commit 9759601 (build 4663, previous stable).\n6. **Unresolved:** the log ends at 03:20:48 with ledger-sync stalls still occurring and no post-rollback health confirmation; also note the rollback target (build 4663) is not the aborted build 2985, so it is unclear the defective artifact was actually removed.", "k": 1, "reqs": [{"C": 768, "T": 1000, "U": 232, "cost": 6.732e-05, "cw": 0, "in": 232, "out": 35, "stop": "toolUse"}, {"C": 1024, "T": 14394, "U": 13370, "cost": 0.0024312599999999