数据 {"arm": "R", "comps": [], "file": {"bytes": 32051, "lines": 412, "offs": {"A": 1142, "B": 8341, "C": 25471, "D": 31010}, "salt": 0, "sha": "5f2fae7ad97758fc"}, "kind": "run", "marker": "b035423a", "msgs": [{"calls": [{"args": {"path": "./incident.log"}, "tool": "read"}], "final": "**Incident summary — run b035423a, host ops-7, 2026-03-14 03:00–03:20Z**\n\n1. **First failure:** 03:00:49Z — `deploy-ctl` FATAL: ledger-sync rollout aborted, build 1949 failed the health gate on 3 of 5 canary pods.\n2. **Root cause:** a bad ledger-sync artifact (commit f2d49f1 / build 1949) was rolled out to the canary; once partial pods were unhealthy, ledger-sync began stalling (lag 3.6s→10.5s) and payments-gw upstream calls timed out with `circuit=OPEN`, causing cascading 502s from billing-api and 504s at the edge gateways (plus tenant throttling and slow queries).\n3. **Contributing factors:** queue-worker disk on /var/spool repeatedly hit 84–89%, and billing-api slow queries on invoices/tenants/sessions (up to ~2.2s) amplified the timeout pressure.\n4. **Containment:** a later candidate was held back — 03:07:24Z `canary healthy commit=98467a3`, 03:12:30Z `promotion deferred commit=a2c1a24` — so no further traffic was shifted to a bad build.\n5. **Fix:** 03:19:24Z `deploy-ctl` rolled back to the previous stable commit 9f74756 (build 2927); error rates on payments-gw/billing-api and ledger-sync stalls receded immediately after.\n6. **Follow-up:** investigate build 1949's health-gate failures and the /var/spool disk pressure on queue-worker before re-attempting the ledger-sync rollout.", "k": 1, "reqs": [{"C": 768, "T": 1000, "U": 232, "cost": 6.732e-05, "cw": 0, "in": 232, "out": 35, "stop": "toolUse"}, {"C": 1024, "T": 14508, "U": 13484, "cost": 0.0023349599999999996, "cw": 0, "in": 13484, "out": 495, "stop": "stop"}], "results": [{"blocked": false, "chars": 32051, "err": false, "g7": {"A": 1, "B": 1, "C": 1, "D": 1}, "marker": true, "nested": null, "tool": "read"}]}, {"calls": [],