 facts.\n\n**Context:** `# incident export run=811caf49 host=ops-7 window=03:00-04:10`, dated `2026-03-14`.\n\n## (1) What failed first\n\n- **03:00:45.600Z FATAL deploy-ctl** — `rollout aborted: ledger-sync build 2785 failed the health gate on 3 of 5 pods`\n  - This is the first FATAL and the first actual failure. Preceded by `2026-03-14T03:00:08.699Z INFO deploy-ctl rollout started: ledger-sync canary 1 of 5 pods` and `2026-03-14T03:00:16.170Z INFO deploy-ctl artifact fetched commit=470e97f`.\n- Before that, the only earlier anomalies were warnings: `edge-gw-1 req=60ae10 retry attempt=2 route=/v2/session` (03:00:05.374Z), `queue-worker disk usage 79% on /var/spool` (03:00:12.129Z), `billing-api slow query 1997ms table=invoices` (03:00:27.562Z).\n- The user-visible error cascade begins at **2026-03-14T03:06:22.583Z ERROR payments-gw req=ddb694 upstream timeout after 30000ms circuit=OPEN**, followed by `2026-03-14T03:06:32.060Z ERROR edge-gw-1 req=a43d5f 504 gateway timeout route=/v2/session` and `2026-03-14T03:06:42.612Z ERROR billing-api req=ef2da4 502 from payments-gw`.\n\n## (2) Root cause\n\nThe log does not state a root cause explicitly; it must be inferred. The evidence points to **payments-gw upstream failure with its circuit breaker open**, propagating to billing-api and edge-gw:\n\n- `payments-gw req=ddb694 upstream timeout after 30000ms circuit=OPEN` (03:06:22.583Z), recurring at 03:11:39.899Z (`req=e00b5f`), 03:11:57.867Z (`req=03", "tool": "delegate"}]}, {"calls": [], "final": "OK", "k": 2, "reqs": [{"C": 2432, "T": 2481, "U": 49, "cost": 4.5629999999999995e-05, "cw": 0, "in": 49, "out": 3, "stop": "stop"}], "results": []}, {"calls": [], "final": "OK", "k": 3, "reqs": [{"C": 2432, "T": 2500, "U": 68, "cost": 4.848e-05, "cw": 0, "in": 68, "out": 3, "stop": "stop"}], "results": []}, {"calls": [], "final": "OK", "k": 4, "reqs": [{"C": 2432, "T": 2519, "U": 87, "cost": 5.133e-05, "cw": 0, "in": 87, "out": 3, "stop": "stop"}], "results": []}, {"calls": [], "